Description: Safe application removal and leftover cleanup for Ubuntu
 AppSweep provides a native GTK application for reviewing and removing
 software installed through APT, Snap, and Flatpak.
 .
 It analyzes removal effects, protects critical system components,
 detects application data, and supports verified rollback backups.
